OL,3,GNEWSAFormer teacher jailed over sexual
OL,4,Aassault of boys
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former primary school teacher who
OL,7,Fsexually assaulted and falsely
OL,8,Fimprisoned two boys has been jailed for
OL,9,Fover four years.
OL,11,FJoseph Haffenden, 32, previously
OL,12,Fadmitted sexual assault by touching
OL,13,Fafter the two children reported he had
OL,14,Ftickled them under their clothing in a
OL,15,F"game" using a feather, an electric
OL,16,Ftoothbrush and his hands, Sussex Police
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,19,FSearches of his home later uncovered
OL,20,Fitems which "suggested an interest in
OL,21,Fchildren", following the incidents in
OL,22,FJanuary and February 2026.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
