OL,3,GNEWSAFormer teacher jailed over sexual
OL,4,Aassault of boys
OL,5,
OL,6,FHaffenden, of Lindfield High Street,
OL,7,Falso admitted six counts of false
OL,8,Fimprisonment, and was sentenced to 51
OL,9,Fmonths in prison on 3 September.
